  "name": "The Intake Back Alley",
  "description": "The service alley behind Lowlight Intake and Hae's Noodles on Level 4, roofed by the girders and pipes of the level above. A steel stair climbs the brick to the Intake's back door under a caged lamp, beside a small lit window. Below, Hae's kitchen door stands propped open a hand's width on crates of greens and noodles, stockpots drying beside it, a fan unit humming above. Further down, dumpsters, pallets, an upturned crate with a tin-can ashtray and a folding stool under the red neon bowl-and-chopsticks; past the girders, a slice of the city's towers.",
